  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Mykolaiv Recovered Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to support the green recovery of Mykolaiv City and Oblast supported by new employment opportunities, restored and enhanced public and security services and an inclusive and transparent local governance. 

These results will be obtained by recovery offices in the city, administrative social services, community resilience and civil society engagement with a focus on youth as well as vocational and educational training.</narrative>
  </description>
